  ('ps-24-1', 'gen-1-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Genesis 1:1''s declaration that God created the heavens and the earth establishes the foundational basis for Psalm 24:1''s claim that everything belongs to the Lord — ownership flows from creatorship.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.105Z'),
  ('ps-24-2', 'gen-1-9', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The founding of earth upon seas directly alludes to the creation account where God gathers waters and causes dry land to appear, establishing the cosmic order.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.105Z'),
  ('ps-3-7', 'alma-33-10', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.105Z'),
  ('ps-33-6', 'gen-1-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Genesis 1:1 opens the creation account that this verse interprets theologically, attributing the making of the heavens to the spoken word and breath of the Lord.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.272Z'),
  ('ps-33-7', 'gen-1-9', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"God''s gathering of the seas into one place at creation directly underlies Psalm 33:7''s image of God collecting the waters of the sea together, anchoring the verse in the creation narrative.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.272Z'),
  ('ps-33-9', 'gen-1-3', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Psalm 33:9''s ''he spake, and it was done'' directly alludes to the repeated creation formula ''And God said… and it was so'' in Genesis 1, asserting the same absolute efficacy of the divine word.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.272Z'),
  ('ps-34-8', 'alma-32-28', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Alma invites the Zoramites to plant the word and ''taste'' its goodness if it is good, using the same experiential, gustatory metaphor of Psalm 34:8 to prove divine truth through personal experience.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.272Z'),
  ('ps-37-4', 'enos-1-12', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.442Z'),
  ('ps-37-5', '1-ne-3-7', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Nephi''s declaration that God ''shall prepare a way'' for those who commit to His commands reflects the same principle as ''he shall bring it to pass'' for those who commit their way to the Lord.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.442Z'),
  ('ps-5-2', '1-ne-3-14', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The declaration ''unto thee will I pray'' mirrors the Book of Mormon pattern of directing all petition exclusively to God as King, reflecting the same monotheistic prayer orientation.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.608Z'),
  ('ps-65-4', 'enos-1-27', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:13.778Z'),
  ('ps-74-16', 'gen-1-16', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Both passages affirm that God created and governs the sun and the distinction between day and night, with the psalm echoing the creation account''s establishment of the two great lights.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-74-17', 'gen-1-14', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Both passages describe God establishing the fixed divisions of time and seasons, with the psalm''s ''summer and winter'' reflecting the creation mandate to govern times and seasons.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-8-3', 'gen-1-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The psalmist''s reference to the heavens, moon, and stars as ''the work of thy fingers'' alludes directly to the creation account in Genesis where God makes the heavens and celestial bodies.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-8-5', 'gen-1-26', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The crowning of man with glory and honour in Psalm 8:5 alludes to the image-of-God language in Genesis 1:26, where humanity is given dominion and dignity as the pinnacle of creation.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-8-6', 'gen-1-28', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Both passages describe God granting humanity dominion over the created order, using the language of rulership and subjection of all things under human authority.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-8-7', 'gen-1-25', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Both verses enumerate the same categories of domesticated animals and beasts of the field as part of God''s created order placed under human stewardship.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-8-8', 'gen-1-26', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Both passages enumerate the fowl of the air and fish of the sea as creatures over which God grants humanity dominion, mirroring the creation mandate language.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-8-8', 'gen-1-28', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The specific listing of fish of the sea and fowl of the air alludes to the dominion mandate of Genesis 1:28, echoing the same categories of creatures placed under human authority.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.122Z'),
  ('ps-89-11', 'gen-1-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Genesis 1:1 establishes that God created the heavens and the earth, grounding the ownership claim of Psalm 89:11 — ''the heavens are thine, the earth also is thine'' — in the act of creation.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.428Z'),
  ('ps-95-5', 'gen-1-9', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The declaration ''his hands formed the dry land'' directly alludes to the Genesis creation account where God gathers the waters and causes the dry land to appear, grounding the psalm''s worship in the original act of creation.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.577Z'),
  ('ps-96-5', 'gen-1-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The contrast ''the Lord made the heavens'' in Psalm 96:5 directly alludes to Genesis 1:1''s ''In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth,'' grounding God''s superiority over idols in the creation account.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.577Z'),
  ('rev-14-12', '1-ne-3-16', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.752Z'),
  ('rev-14-12', '1-ne-3-21', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:14.752Z'),
  ('rom-10-15', 'dc-4-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Doctrine and Covenants 4:1 opens with a call to those who will serve in the Lord''s harvest, echoing the Romans 10:15 principle that preachers must be sent and commissioned before the gospel can reach those who need to hear it.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:15.436Z'),
  ('rom-14-2', 'gen-1-29', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The original Edenic diet of herbs and plants provides the scriptural backdrop that may underlie the ''weak'' believer''s vegetarian restriction referenced in this verse.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:16.095Z'),
  ('w-of-m-1-18', 'dc-4-2', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The phrase ''all the might of his body and the faculty of his whole soul'' mirrors the Doctrine and Covenants call to serve God with ''all your heart, might, mind and strength,'' describing total consecration of self in righteous labor.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:02:17.961Z'),
