  ('dc-14-4', 'dc-4-3', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"D&C 4:3 similarly states ''Therefore, if ye have desires to serve God ye are called to the work,'' connecting the act of reaping with the principle that desire and action constitute a divine call.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:28.074Z'),
