  ('deut-4-23', 'enos-1-16', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:29.475Z'),
  ('eccl-1-5', 'gen-1-14', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Genesis establishes the sun as a created light appointed to govern the day in fixed cycles, grounding the Preacher''s observation of solar regularity in the creational order.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:29.863Z'),
  ('eccl-12-13', '1-ne-3-7', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Ecclesiastes asserts that keeping God''s commandments is the whole duty of man, and Nephi''s declaration that ''the Lord giveth no commandment... save he shall prepare a way'' reflects the same foundational commitment to unconditional obedience as the core of covenant life.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:29.863Z'),
  ('eccl-3-11', 'gen-1-31', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Ecclesiastes'' declaration that God ''hath made every thing beautiful in his time'' echoes Genesis'' refrain that God saw everything He had made and it was ''very good,'' affirming the inherent goodness of divine creation.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:29.863Z'),
  ('eccl-4-13', 'alma-32-12', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:29.863Z'),
  ('eccl-7-29', 'gen-1-31', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Qohelet''s declaration that ''God hath made man upright'' alludes to the creation narrative in which God surveys His work and calls it ''very good,'' grounding the original human condition in divine integrity before subsequent corruption through ''many inventions.''","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-1', '2-ne-2-1', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Enos describes his father Jacob as ''a just man'' who taught him faithfully, while Jacob''s own record in 2 Nephi 2:1 shows Lehi similarly addressing Jacob with intimate parental instruction—establishing the same pattern of a righteous father whose teachings shape a son''s spiritual wrestle.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-1', 'prov-22-6', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Enos credits his father Jacob for teaching him ''in the nurture and admonition of the Lord,'' directly embodying Proverbs'' command to ''train up a child in the way he should go,'' with the verse showing the generational result of that parental fidelity.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-10', '2-ne-1-7', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Lehi''s covenant promise that the land ''shall be free from all nations'' if the people keep the commandments, and cursed if they do not, is the direct background for the Lord''s statement to Enos that the land is holy and cursed only for iniquity.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"allusion"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-10', 'alma-45-16', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Alma prophesies that the Lord will curse the land and visit sorrow upon the Nephites according to their transgressions, using the same conditional covenant framework the Lord articulates to Enos.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-10', 'gen-8-21', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-10', 'hel-13-17', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Samuel the Lamanite''s prophecy that the Nephites'' transgressions will bring a curse upon the land fulfills the very conditional warning the Lord gave Enos, showing the long-term outworking of this covenantal principle.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"prophecy-fulfillment"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-10', 'lev-18-28', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The Mosaic warning that the promised land will ''vomit out'' its inhabitants for iniquity is the Old World parallel to the Lord''s declaration to Enos that the holy land is cursed only when wickedness demands it.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-11', '1-sam-7-5', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-11', '2-ne-26-25', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Nephi''s declaration that the Lord invites all to come to him, including enemies and those who persecute, provides doctrinal grounding for why Enos''s faith grows ''unshaken'' as he intercedes even for the hostile Lamanites.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-11', 'alma-17-9', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The sons of Mosiah undertake their Lamanite mission after years of prayer and fasting for their enemies'' welfare, directly echoing the pattern Enos establishes of ''long strugglings'' in intercession for the Lamanites.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-11', 'alma-34-26', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Amulek''s exhortation to ''pour out your souls'' and ''wrestle before God'' with ''long strugglings'' in prayer for others mirrors Enos''s description of his own prolonged intercessory struggle for the Lamanites.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-11', 'eph-6-18', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-11', 'gen-20-7', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"source":"bible-bom-curated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-12', '3-ne-18-20', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Christ''s promise that whatever is asked in his name, if righteous, will be granted, directly parallels the Lord''s response to Enos—faith-grounded, righteous desire as the condition for receiving divine promises.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-12', 'alma-29-4', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Alma''s reflection that God grants unto men according to their desires, whether good or evil, provides the doctrinal principle underlying the Lord''s specific promise to Enos that his righteous desires will be granted because of faith.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-12', 'dc-6-8', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"The Lord''s promise to grant ''according to thy desires, because of thy faith'' is echoed in his repeated promise in the Doctrine and Covenants to give according to righteous desires and diligent faith.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"parallel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
  ('enos-1-12', 'mosiah-4-21', 'CROSS_REF', 'phase-b', '{"reason":"Benjamin''s teaching that God is ''a God of truth and cannot lie'' who freely grants petitions to those who ask in faith connects to the Lord''s faithful fulfillment of his promise to Enos according to his desires and faith.","source":"ai-generated","to_label":"LM_Verse","from_label":"LM_Verse","relationship":"thematic"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', '2026-07-01T22:01:30.070Z'),
