  ('person:moses-1', 'person', 'Moses', 'Moses is referenced as the one through whom the Lord commanded the law, specifically the ordinance that Israel should dwell in booths during the feast of the seventh month.', '{"role":"prophet","neo4j_id":"moses-1","time_period":"1300–1200 BC","significance":"referenced","disambiguation":"lawgiver of Israel"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', 'phase-b', '''booth'':23B ''command'':12B ''dwell'':21B ''feast'':26B ''israel'':19B ''law'':14B ''lord'':11B ''month'':30B ''mose'':1A,2B ''one'':7B ''ordin'':17B ''referenc'':4B ''seventh'':29B ''specif'':15B'::tsvector),
