  ('baptism', 'principle', 'Baptism', 'The ordinance of immersion in water performed by one holding authority, symbolizing the covenant to serve God and witness the remission of sins.', '{"category":"ordinance"}'::jsonb, 'anthropic-batch', 'phase-b', '''author'':12B ''baptism'':1A ''coven'':15B ''god'':18B ''hold'':11B ''immers'':5B ''one'':10B ''ordin'':3B ''perform'':8B ''remiss'':22B ''serv'':17B ''sin'':24B ''symbol'':13B ''water'':7B ''wit'':20B'::tsvector),
